    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Cats Hidden Around the World 2 is a cute hidden object game set worldwide!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0by the creator of Cats Hidden in Paris</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951880/extras/63659e6c3f031d915c75ea96a0431041.avif?t=1750523527\" width=600 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the sandy beaches of Dubai, linger around the ancient streets of Rome or enjoy the bustling life of Bangkok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found a cat? Click on it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e 20 Level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc08 2000 cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2754 Easter Eggs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udca1 Hint System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 Night Mode </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Adjustable Brightness </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 Timer mode with leaderboard </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Adjustable background &amp; cats color</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Cats Hidden Around the World 2 is a cute hidden object game set worldwide!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0by the creator of Cats Hidden in Paris</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951880/extras/63659e6c3f031d915c75ea96a0431041.avif?t=1750523527\" width=600 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the sandy beaches of Dubai, linger around the ancient streets of Rome or enjoy the bustling life of Bangkok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found a cat? Click on it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e 20 Level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc08 2000 cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2754 Easter Eggs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udca1 Hint System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 Night Mode </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Adjustable Brightness </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 Timer mode with leaderboard </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Adjustable background &amp; cats color</p>",
